 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "The Levites stood in the court that day",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.44,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Jeshua and Kadmiel led the way",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.51,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Bani and Hashabneiah stood tall",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.01,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Sherebiah and Hodiah heard the call",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.35,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Shebaniah and Pethahiah joined in",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.21,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To bless the Lord from past to present",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Blessed be your glorious name",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.77,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Which is exalted above all fame",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.94,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Above every blessing and praise",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.61,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "We lift our voices in the haze",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.43,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They bound themselves with a curse and an oath",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.74,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
